<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Potash said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Potash said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Potash Corp of Saskatchewan Inc was raised to accumulate from neutral at Dean Witter, according to a source at Dean Witter.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 72-5/8 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
